<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 6-mo BUBOR rate up 0.01 pct, rest steady.</title>
<headline>Hungary 6-mo BUBOR rate up 0.01 pct, rest steady.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) were steady for the one- and three-month maturities and rose 0.01 percent for six months, the National Bank of Hungary said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.29 percent and the three-month rate at 21.15 percent, while the six-month rate rose to 21.02 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
